"Phryne's divinity is cracked and leaks into the aether."
"Years later, in the Ostren war, she blesses the Ashen host, invoking Quenfi, Edes and Dravik."
"Khachi's blessing on that host proves stronger than hers."
"She says godheads no longer exist, yet Khachi holds one."
"She debates worship with Khachi and is cloistered with him; he may learn her prayer cadence."
"She loses a bet to Colborn and gives him a crystalline sword of wizardry and divinity."
"She is one of five elder Questors who escort the Heirs to the Conclave."
"Nine years later she conjures divine shields for the Continuance Council at Dawn's Concord."
